  "solution": {
    "text": "In d-block elements,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CrO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math><sub>&nbsp;</sub>exhibit strong attraction to magnetic fields and are able to retain their magnetic properties.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MnO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is anti-ferromagnetic and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CrO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is ferromagnetic.",
